{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16016","headline":"题台州隐静寺 · 王建","name":"题台州隐静寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐静灵仙寺天凿，杯度飞来建岩壑。\n五峰直上插银河，一涧当空泻寥廓。\n崆峒黯淡碧琉璃，白云吞吐红莲阁。\n不知势压天几重，钟声常闻月中落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}